            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The terms link is unavailable in this build."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El enlace a los términos no está disponible en esta versión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get help": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get help"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obtener ayuda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Describe the steps, what you expected and what happened. Leave out grocery details, budgets, names, receipts, sign-in codes and invitation links.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe the steps, what you expected and what happened. Leave out grocery details, budgets, names, receipts, sign-in codes and invitation links."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe los pasos, lo que esperabas y lo que ocurrió. Omite detalles de comestibles, presupuestos, nombres, recibos, códigos de inicio de sesión y enlaces de invitación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open support": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open support"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir soporte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An online support destination is unavailable in this build. Offline help and the support summary are still available.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An online support destination is unavailable in this build. Offline help and the support summary are still available."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No hay un destino de soporte en línea disponible en esta versión. La ayuda sin conexión y el resumen de soporte siguen disponibles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read offline help": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read offline help"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leer ayuda sin conexión"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review support summary": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review support summary"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revisar resumen de soporte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This summary contains only the app version, build, iOS version, interface language, build environment and whether service and membership configuration are present. It contains no groceries, money, account or device identifiers, credentials, logs or photos.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This summary contains only the app version, build, iOS version, interface language, build environment and whether service and membership configuration are present. It contains no groceries, money, account or device identifiers, credentials, logs or photos."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este resumen contiene solo la versión de la app, la compilación, la versión de iOS, el idioma de la interfaz, el entorno de compilación y si existe configuración del servicio y de la membresía. No contiene comestibles, dinero, identificadores de cuenta o dispositivo, credenciales, registros técnicos ni fotos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share support summary": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share support summary"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compartir resumen de soporte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is sent automatically. Review the summary and choose its destination in the share sheet. A personal recovery file is a separate private export; support does not need it by default.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing is sent automatically. Review the summary and choose its destination in the share sheet. A personal recovery file is a separate private export; support does not need it by default."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se envía nada automáticamente. Revisa el resumen y elige su destino en la hoja para compartir. Un archivo personal de recuperación es una exportación privada separada; soporte no lo necesita de forma predeterminada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Compare packs in Shop. Enter the amount you need, the usable amount in each pack and the price. If the package uses a different kind of unit, enter two equivalent amounts from its label or your own measurement, such as 120 grams of this flour for 1 cup. Without that information, leave the conversion blank.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Compare packs in Shop. Enter the amount you need, the usable amount in each pack and the price. If the package uses a different kind of unit, enter two equivalent amounts from its label or your own measurement, such as 120 grams of this flour for 1 cup. Without that information, leave the conversion blank."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre Comparar paquetes en Compras. Ingresa la cantidad que necesitas, la cantidad aprovechable de cada paquete y su precio. Si el paquete usa otro tipo de unidad, ingresa dos cantidades equivalentes de la etiqueta o de una medición propia, por ejemplo, 120 gramos de esa harina por 1 taza. Si no tienes ese dato, deja la conversión en blanco."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app’s capture tools process speech and images on this iPhone. Raw voice recordings are not retained or uploaded by the app. Saved evidence photos stay in protected local storage. Readable and helper exports exclude photos. An encrypted recovery file can include evidence photos only after you select and review them. Apple may download a photo you select from iCloud before delivering it to the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app’s capture tools process speech and images on this iPhone. Raw voice recordings are not retained or uploaded by the app. Saved evidence photos stay in protected local storage. Readable and helper exports exclude photos. An encrypted recovery file can include evidence photos only after you select and review them. Apple may download a photo you select from iCloud before delivering it to the app."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las herramientas de captura de la app procesan la voz y las imágenes en este iPhone. La app no conserva ni sube las grabaciones de voz originales. Las fotos guardadas como evidencia permanecen en almacenamiento local protegido. Las exportaciones legibles y para ayudantes excluyen las fotos. Un archivo de recuperación cifrado puede incluir fotos de evidencia solo después de que las selecciones y revises. Apple puede descargar de iCloud una foto que selecciones antes de entregarla a la app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional household measurement is separate. With explicit consent, the service stores the response codes you review, the shop identity, eligible week and notice version, and can match membership status to study retention. Existing local feedback, grocery text, prices and member names are not sent. Manage or withdraw that consent in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional household measurement is separate. With explicit consent, the service stores the response codes you review, the shop identity, eligible week and notice version, and can match membership status to study retention. Existing local feedback, grocery text, prices and member names are not sent. Manage or withdraw that consent in Settings."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La medición opcional del hogar es independiente. Con consentimiento explícito, el servicio guarda los códigos de respuesta que revises, la identidad de la compra, la semana elegible y la versión del aviso, y puede vincular el estado de membresía para estudiar la retención. No se envían los comentarios locales existentes, el texto de comestibles, los precios ni los nombres de miembros. Administra o retira ese consentimiento en Configuración."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Email support": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Email support"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enviar correo a soporte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose your email app and review the message before sending. No message is sent automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose your email app and review the message before sending. No message is sent automatically."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige tu app de correo y revisa el mensaje antes de enviarlo. No se envía ningún mensaje automáticamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Operator": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Operator"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Operador"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
